{
  "info": {
    "name": "Daily Task API (Go Fiber + Clean Architecture)",
    "description": "Mini project daily task (tasks + goals). Backend Go Fiber + database/sql (pgx), tanpa ORM.\n\nCara pakai:\n1. Jalankan API: `go run ./cmd/api`\n2. Pilih environment \"Daily Task API - Local\", atau biarkan pakai variable koleksi `baseUrl`.\n3. Jalankan request berurutan dari atas. Request \"Create task\" dan \"Create goals\" otomatis menyimpan `taskId` / `goalsId`, jadi request Detail/Update/Download/Delete langsung terpakai tanpa ketik ID manual.\n\nUntuk request yang mengirim file, klik kolom `file` di tab Body > form-data lalu pilih file dari komputer Anda (Postman tidak bisa menyimpan path file di dalam koleksi).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "taskId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "goalsId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["health"]
        },
        "description": "Cek service hidup. Kalau gagal connect, pastikan `go run ./cmd/api` sudah jalan dan Postgres aktif."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test(\"service ok\", () => {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.status).to.eql(\"ok\");",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Tasks",
      "description": "CRUD daily task.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create task (dengan file) — multipart",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "no_task",
                  "value": "",
                  "type": "text",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "Opsional. Kalau dikosongkan, server generate TASK-YYYYMMDD-XXXX. Wajib unik."
                },
                {
                  "key": "judul",
                  "value": "Belajar Clean Architecture",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Wajib, 3-255 karakter."
                },
                {
                  "key": "description",
                  "value": "Bikin layer domain, usecase, delivery",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Opsional, maksimal 2000 karakter."
                },
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Opsional. Pilih file dari komputer. Default ekstensi yang diizinkan: .pdf .doc .docx .xls .xlsx .png .jpg .jpeg .zip, maksimal 5 MB."
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tasks"]
            },
            "description": "Buat task baru beserta lampiran. Jangan set header Content-Type manual — Postman mengisinya sendiri lengkap dengan boundary."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"response sukses\", () => pm.expect(body.success).to.be.true);",
                  "pm.test(\"no_task tergenerate\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.no_task).to.match(/^TASK-/);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// simpan id supaya request berikutnya tidak perlu ketik ID manual",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"taskId\", body.data.id);",
                  "console.log(\"taskId disimpan:\", body.data.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create task (tanpa file) — JSON",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"no_task\": \"TASK-001\",\n  \"judul\": \"Setup Database Postgres\",\n  \"description\": \"migrasi tabel tasks\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tasks"]
            },
            "description": "Endpoint yang sama juga menerima JSON kalau tidak ada file yang diupload."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test(\"no_task sesuai yang dikirim\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.no_task).to.eql(\"TASK-001\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List tasks",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks?page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tasks"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "Default 1."
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "10",
                  "description": "Default 10, maksimal 100."
                },
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "Cari di no_task, judul, dan description. Case-insensitive (ILIKE)."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Daftar task terbaru lebih dulu, lengkap dengan `meta` paginasi."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"data berupa array\", () => pm.expect(body.data).to.be.an(\"array\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"ada meta paginasi\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.meta).to.have.property(\"total_pages\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List tasks — pencarian",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks?search=POSTGRES&page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tasks"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "POSTGRES",
                  "description": "Sengaja huruf besar semua untuk membuktikan pencarian case-insensitive."
                },
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "10"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Jalankan \"Create task (tanpa file) — JSON\" lebih dulu. Keyword huruf besar tetap menemukan judul \"Setup Database Postgres\" karena query memakai ILIKE, bukan LIKE."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"pencarian case-insensitive bekerja\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.length).to.be.above(0);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get task by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tasks", "{{taskId}}"]
            },
            "description": "`taskId` terisi otomatis setelah menjalankan \"Create task (dengan file)\"."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"id sesuai\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(String(pm.response.json().data.id)).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"taskId\"));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Download lampiran",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}/download",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tasks", "{{taskId}}", "download"]
            },
            "description": "Isi `file_url` pada response task mengarah ke endpoint ini. File diambil berdasarkan data di database, jadi nama file di disk (yang diacak) tidak pernah terekspos. Pakai Send > Send and Download untuk menyimpan hasilnya."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"dikirim sebagai attachment\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Content-Disposition\")).to.include(\"attachment\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update task — sebagian field (JSON)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"judul\": \"Judul sudah diubah\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tasks", "{{taskId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Field yang tidak dikirim tetap memakai nilai lama. Coba hapus `judul` dan kirim `description` saja — judul tidak akan berubah."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const hasil = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "pm.test(\"judul berubah\", () => pm.expect(hasil.judul).to.eql(\"Judul sudah diubah\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"description tidak ikut terhapus\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(hasil.description).to.not.eql(\"\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update task — ganti lampiran (multipart)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "description",
                  "value": "lampiran sudah direvisi",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Pilih file pengganti. File lama otomatis dihapus dari disk setelah database berhasil diupdate."
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tasks", "{{taskId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Cek folder `uploads/` sebelum dan sesudah request ini — jumlah filenya tetap satu, tidak menumpuk."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"nama file ikut terupdate\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.file_name).to.not.be.empty;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update task — lepas lampiran",
